# ── Heavy media ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Source footage and ProRes renders are hundreds of MB each and blow past
# GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit. The compositions that generate them are
# versioned instead — re-render with `npx hyperframes render`.
footage/*
!footage/.gitkeep
output/*
!output/.gitkeep
*.mov
*.MOV
*.mp4
*.wav

# HyperFrames render scratch
graphics/work-*/
graphics/.*-transaction*/
**/snapshots/
**/renders/

# ── Third-party media ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Jason Cooperson's avatar and video thumbnail are his, not ours. Kept local
# so the credit card renders, not redistributed from this repo.
graphics/jason-card/.media/images/jason_avatar.png
graphics/jason-card/.media/images/jason_thumb.png

# ── Premiere scratch / auto-saves ─────────────────────────────────────────
*.prproj.autosave/
Adobe Premiere Pro Auto-Save/
*.pek
*.cfa

# ── OS / tooling ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
node_modules/
.hf-cache/

# HyperFrames preview thumbnails (regenerated on demand)
**/.thumbnails/
# working backups
*.bak

# The .prproj IS versioned (it's tiny and it's the actual edit) — but its
# auto-save siblings are not.
